 ## Deployment
 
-This application can be deployed to Railway or similar platforms that support Python applications with static file serving.
+This application is designed for deployment to GitHub Pages using GitHub Actions for automatic news updates.
 
-For Railway:
-1. Connect your repository
-2. Set build command to `pip install -r requirements.txt`
-3. Set start command to `python src/news_aggregator.py && python -m http.server 8000`
-4. Configure the platform to serve static files from the root directory
\ No newline at end of file
+1. Push your code to a GitHub repository
+2. Enable GitHub Pages in your repository settings to serve from the main branch
+3. GitHub Actions will automatically run the news aggregator every 6 hours and update the content
+4. No additional hosting costs are required
\ No newline at end of file
